direction_100 = location "Sabertooth" about "Sabertooth\nThe representative carnivore of the Adonis Continent, entire body is shrouded by a protective armor, levels rapid attack" found "El Morad" elmorad at 1724 1191 in zone 2
direction_99 = location "Sabertooth" about "Sabertooth\nThe representative carnivore of the Adonis Continent, entire body is shrouded by a protective armor, levels rapid attack" found "Karus" karus at 881 1296 in zone 1

On available
    Say "These days, Silver Feather is very popular with the society crowd."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "Erm, Silver Feather? Silver Feather shines, even at night~ just wear it once, and you'll feel like a god~~ Heh, It's the one material that's never left out of a noble woman's dress. But, being so valuable, it's a bugger to get hold of."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "I heard that some of the  Saber Tooths have Silver Feathers... But I'm not sure if this is entirely true. Anyway, can you please hunt me down some Silver Feather? I'll make some profit selling it, and you'll get some decent EXP. Everyone's a winner! Hee Hee!\n\nI've heard a rumor that there're ometimes Silver Feathers in amongst the Saber Tooth's feathers."

